### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/

### Register (201, sets session cookie). Duplicate username -> 409
# @name register
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login (200, sets session cookie). Wrong password / unknown user -> 401
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Me (200). Uses the cookie jar populated by login above.
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me

### Change password (204). Revokes every other session.
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/change-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "current_password": "password123",
  "new_password": "newpassword1"
}

### Login with the new password (200, refreshes the cookie).
# @name login2
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "password": "newpassword1"
}

### Logout (204, clears the cookie).
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/logout

### Me after logout (401).
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me
